  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Design cost for Phase II of support to Private Infrastructure Development Group (PIDG) is a component of PIDG2 - Second phase of FCDO&apos;s Support to the Private Infrastructure Development Group .  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;129,607. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Energy generation, non-renewable sources, unspecified, Transport policy and administrative management, Information and communication technology (ICT), Low-cost housing, Sanitation - large systems, Agricultural services.</narrative>
